How I did the case study and insights found:
I analyzed the Bright Coffee Shop sales data by first cleaning and organizing it to ensure accuracy. 
I then examined revenue by product, tracked sales patterns across different times of day, and visualized trends using charts to make insights clear.
From this analysis, I found that certain products generated the highest revenue, peak sales occurred during mornings and lunch hours, and some products had consistent demand while others fluctuated by day.
Based on these insights, I recommended optimizing stock for top-selling items and introducing promotions during slower periods to boost overall sales.
